    css_rule_body_comment_decl_leak_2026-11-28, 0, "Registered 2026-11-28 by p3sweep5 wave-11 lane while closing html_css_rendering_inventory_lexical_false_pass_2026-09-05: declarations inside a /* */ comment leak into the cascade when they follow a ; inside a CSS rule body (.box{/* background-color:#d04060;width:40px;height:20px */} applies width/height but not background-color - naive ; split, only the first token carries the /* prefix). Top-level commented rules are correctly inert. Root-cause direction: strip comment spans on the raw rule body before ; tokenization. The document remains the authority for diagnosis and acceptance."

